# label: alg:ch89-app
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch89.tex:117
# caption: Evaluate strict application under lexical scope.

REQUIRE typed application app(f,a), lexical environment rho
ENSURE result under left-to-right call-by-value, or evaluation failure/budget status
evaluate f in rho to closure (x,body,rho_c)
evaluate a in rho to argument value v
extend rho_c with a new binding x |-> v
evaluate body in that extended environment

